--- for-loop-destructuring-without-parentheses ---
// Destructuring without parentheses.
// Error: 7-8 unexpected comma
// Hint: 7-8 destructuring patterns must be wrapped in parentheses
#for k, v in (a: 4, b: 5) {
  dont-care
}
│ fn $top:
│   b0:
│     v0 = const text " "
│     v1 = const text " "
│     v2 = const text " "
│     v3 = error msg="unexpected comma" hint="destructuring patterns must be wrapped in parentheses"
│     v4 = content_result [v0, v1, v2]
│     return v4

